If you are on the budget, Baofeng DM-1701 is a good choice.<br><br>If you want GPS functionality and can spend a little more, Retevis RT3S with GPS is a great choice.<br><br>Please stay away from TYT MD UV 390 Plus or non plus version. There is a mixed up in the manufacturing process, hence there are too many variations of the hardware in the same radio model.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=5068">KA1CM</a> — Wed Mar 26, 2025 2:52 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
